+| 57–63 | `rule-da9594733502733c5baea5c07345e60cff4228109cd5931016f3801b06910350` | none | `DEFINITION` |
+| 65–70 | `rule-6d751676da4edbf999ca6d4c967d22060cd612334941e4e2f1dd1c404926d54e` | none | `DEFINITION` |
